WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.219 --> 00:00:03.536
CHRIS PRATT
When I first came on to play Peter Quill,

00:00:03.586 --> 00:00:07.304
the Guardians of the Galaxy were like,
you know, this ragtag squad of nobodies.

00:00:09.523 --> 00:00:11.013
JAMES GUNN
I turned in my first draft of

00:00:11.063 --> 00:00:15.316
the screenplay, and I was really afraid.
But I felt good about it.

00:00:15.617 --> 00:00:17.028
KEVIN FEIGE
People didn't understand why we were doing

00:00:17.078 --> 00:00:20.045
that space movie with
a tree and a raccoon.

00:00:20.533 --> 00:00:22.403
DAVE BAUTISTA
I think the Guardians are so imperfect,

00:00:22.453 --> 00:00:24.710
their pasts are not squeaky clean.

00:00:24.760 --> 00:00:26.842
KEVIN FEIGE
This found family putting trauma

00:00:26.892 --> 00:00:30.842
behind them to become their best selves.
There's something really special

00:00:30.892 --> 00:00:31.892
about that.

00:00:35.338 --> 00:00:36.841
KAREN GILLAN
I looked around the other day

00:00:36.891 --> 00:00:41.003
and was just like, this casting is
so right. Like, how did they do that?

00:00:41.053 --> 00:00:42.179
How did they find us all?

00:00:43.774 --> 00:00:44.872
ZOE SALDAÑA
For each and every one of us

00:00:44.922 --> 00:00:48.668
to live within the Marvel Universe,
it's been very, very special.

00:00:48.719 --> 00:00:51.604
Everybody always comes to work
with the same level of excitement

00:00:51.654 --> 00:00:52.719
since day one.

00:00:54.044 --> 00:00:57.974
We are very much committed to
James' vision. He's a great captain.

00:00:58.806 --> 00:01:00.641
He really believes in this story.

00:01:00.692 --> 00:01:02.646
JAMES GUNN
Welcome to Guardians of the Galaxy!

00:01:02.696 --> 00:01:04.442
[Cheering]

00:01:04.493 --> 00:01:05.909
POM KLEMENTIEFF
You know, we have so much fun

00:01:05.959 --> 00:01:10.095
because there is so much
comedy in it and so much emotion.

00:01:10.157 --> 00:01:11.493
SEAN GUNN
Being on set with everyone,

00:01:11.543 --> 00:01:15.211
knowing that there's a finality
to the whole experience

00:01:15.261 --> 00:01:16.868
really made me very emotional.

00:01:16.918 --> 00:01:18.019
JAMES GUNN
I mean, we're a family.

00:01:18.069 --> 00:01:20.723
They're all people that
I want to keep in my life.

00:01:20.774 --> 00:01:22.044
CHRIS PRATT
To be part of something that's just

00:01:22.094 --> 00:01:26.574
so universally beloved, it's special.
It's hard to even put into words.

00:01:27.902 --> 00:01:30.184
It's been a blast.

00:01:30.836 --> 00:01:32.075
PETER QUILL
Are you ready?

00:01:40.072 --> 00:01:41.906
PETER QUILL
Woohoo!

00:01:46.239 --> 00:01:47.548
DRAX
Yeah!

